Stage H complete. Six probe/mutant pairs in `07-feasibility/`, all twelve verdicts meeting the bar from a clean state.

## The probes

| Probe | Shape | Mutant | Verdict pair |
|---|---|---|---|
| `recv-table` | main transition, table half (lines 203-218) | promiscuous learning: drops the line-214 target test | SAFE / refuted |
| `merge-before-opcode` | opcode independence of the table outcome | **reads ar$op first, learns only from REPLY** | SAFE / refuted |
| `recv-reply` | reply construction (lines 219-225) | ar$op flipped, line-221 swap never done | SAFE / refuted |
